    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从阿勒泰因部队服役嫁到伊犁的退役军人，在新疆伊犁扎根发展婚礼策划业务。作为婚礼策划人，她凭借专业和真诚赢得了客户的信赖。在这期节目中，小鱼姐分享了她从军旅生活到选择婚礼策划行业的心路历程，她的独特服务：包括目的地旅行婚礼、婚礼管家等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她的成功不仅源于对工作的热爱，还源于她坚持和真诚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想了解更多关于小鱼姐如何实现从军营到婚礼策划的华丽转身吗？这期节目不容错过。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtmXXqvpNUEKKnrJ12plOpn7UiP1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a>:新疆姑娘的勇敢选择：退役军属在伊利的坚强之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">00:04:03</a>:从军营到婚礼策划：一个人生转折的奋斗故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">00:08:10</a>:“用心去给，真诚打动——婚礼策划师的职业感悟”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="736">00:12:16</a>:独特想法与真诚打动人心：一家婚礼策划公司的不同之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">00:16:21</a>:新疆之行，感悟人文魅力，体验真正的目的地婚礼！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">00:20:27</a>:用心服务，让婚礼不留遗憾！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">00:24:32</a>:新模式下的巨大困难。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1718">00:28:38</a>:孕期工作的艰辛与挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">00:32:44</a>:创业压力与独立女性观点：一名成功女性的内心探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">00:36:50</a>:在有限时间内创造无限人生价值的重要性！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2455">00:40:55</a>:生活与工作：如何保持平衡？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">00:45:00</a>:伊宁市小城镇的创业之路：经验和建议分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Suqin365chunye</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6w8pV-yq3yEEsrxsYFxRAYYwe-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【🔗我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：霖子的成长日记</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：霖里软装布艺工作室</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：霖子</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：霖子</span></p><span></span><p><span>创作不易，感谢支持！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvXP3-UCGkVNssk3DpwpZdTmwIpV.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
